    "body": "The new symbol doesn't render in the browser (or in a text editor if using an unpatched font)\n\nUsing a symbol that's included in most (all?) Fonts, it ensures that this part of the documentation is readable / understandable for anyone - especially as that section of the docs isn't nodejs-specific.\n\nI thought I'd put this reasoning in the commit message, but it looks like I didn't force push my most recent message amendment before merging, so it still (confusingly) refers to the old symbol.",
